* 條碼檢測範本。打開就能跑。
* 讀 samples/codes.png。右邊是 EAN-13，左邊是 QR。
* Text 是一維碼。QrText 是二維碼。兩個都從 1 開始。
Vizion.read_image (Image, 'samples/codes.png')
Vizion.create_bar_code_model ('', '', Handle)
Vizion.find_bar_code (Image, Symbol, Handle, 'auto', Decoded)
Vizion.tuple_length (Decoded, Count)
Text := Decoded[1]
Vizion.create_data_code_2d_model ('QR Code', '', '', DataCode)
Vizion.find_data_code_2d (Image, CodeXld, DataCode, '', '', CodeId, CodeText)
QrText := CodeText[1]
Vizion.dev_display (Image)
Vizion.dev_display (Symbol)
Vizion.dev_display (CodeXld)
